---
/**
 * The platform section: a heading, then six feature rows.
 *
 * Each row is its own <section>, not a child of one tall section, so the
 * "every section fits the window" rule (fitAuto) applies row by row — the
 * stack as a whole is ~3,700px and would otherwise be left as drawn. The
 * spacing is the design's: the heading section drops its bottom padding, the
 * rows carry their own, and the last row takes the section's bottom padding.
 */
---

<section class="sec sec-feat-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head center sec-head-feat reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The platform</span>
      <h2>Everything You Need to Run Your eSIM <em>Business.</em></h2>
      <p>From global connectivity to customer management, run your entire travel eSIM business on one integrated platform.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feat-row feat-row--first">
  <div class="wrap">
<div class="frow reveal">
        <div class="ftext">
          <h3>Unified Connectivity Dashboard</h3>
          <p>Every market, plan, and eSIM in one view. AI insights help your team respond quickly and keep the business agile as you expand.</p>
          <p class="flink"><a class="link" href="/controlhub/">Explore ControlHub →</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="fvis" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="ui ui-dark">
            <div class="mini-head"><span class="mono-label">Margin by market</span><span class="chip">Live</span></div>
            <div class="row"><span>Japan</span><div class="bar"><span style="width:78%"></span></div><b>78%</b></div>
            <div class="row"><span>Europe</span><div class="bar"><span style="width:64%"></span></div><b>64%</b></div>
            <div class="row"><span>Global</span><div class="bar"><span style="width:52%"></span></div><b>52%</b></div>
            <div class="row"><span>Americas</span><div class="bar"><span style="width:41%"></span></div><b>41%</b></div>
            <div class="mini-foot">
              <div><span class="mono-label">Active eSIMs</span><strong>42,318</strong></div>
              <div><span class="mono-label">Markets</span><strong>180+</strong></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feat-row">
  <div class="wrap">
<div class="frow rev reveal">
        <div class="ftext">
          <h3>Global coverage</h3>
          <p>Seamless connectivity in 180+ countries, so you can launch and expand into new markets without new carrier contracts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fvis fvis-map" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="dotmap"></div>
          <span class="tag-live" style="top:4%;left:5%">United States · live</span>
          <span class="tag-live" style="top:22%;right:4%">Japan · live</span>
          <span class="tag-live" style="bottom:4%;left:8%">Brazil · live</span>
          <div class="ui ui-light ui-narrow">
            <div class="ui-head"><b>Coverage</b><span class="mono-label">180+ countries</span></div>
            <div class="cov"><span class="cc">US</span><span>United States</span><em>5G</em></div>
            <div class="cov"><span class="cc">JP</span><span>Japan</span><em>5G</em></div>
            <div class="cov"><span class="cc">DE</span><span>Germany</span><em>5G</em></div>
            <div class="cov"><span class="cc">BR</span><span>Brazil</span><em>LTE</em></div>
            <div class="ui-foot"><span>30+ operator integrations</span><b>+176</b></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feat-row">
  <div class="wrap">
<div class="frow reveal">
        <div class="ftext">
          <h3>White-label store</h3>
          <p>A custom Shopify marketplace with consumer portals, so travelers buy, install, and manage plans under your brand.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fvis" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="browser">
            <div class="b-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>yourbrand.com/esim</span></div>
            <div class="b-body">
              <div class="store-top"><b>YourBrand</b><span>Plans · Support · Account</span></div>
              <div class="store-search">Where are you traveling?</div>
              <div class="tiles">
                <div class="tile"><span class="cc">JP</span><b>Japan</b><small>10 GB · 30 days</small><div class="tile-foot"><strong>$12</strong><span class="buy">Buy</span></div></div>
                <div class="tile"><span class="cc">EU</span><b>Europe</b><small>5 GB · 30 days</small><div class="tile-foot"><strong>$8</strong><span class="buy">Buy</span></div></div>
                <div class="tile"><span class="cc">GL</span><b>Global</b><small>3 GB · 14 days</small><div class="tile-foot"><strong>$9</strong><span class="buy">Buy</span></div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feat-row">
  <div class="wrap">
<div class="frow rev reveal">
        <div class="ftext">
          <h3>Maximize profits</h3>
          <p>Identify waste, optimize costs, and increase margin with AI. No spreadsheets required.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fvis" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="ui ui-light">
            <div class="ui-head"><b>Margin per plan</b><span class="ai">AI</span></div>
            <div class="stats3">
              <div><small>Wholesale</small><strong>$4.00</strong></div>
              <div><small>Your price</small><strong>$10.00</strong></div>
              <div class="hl"><small>Margin</small><strong>60%</strong></div>
            </div>
            <span class="mono-label sub">Recommendations</span>
            <div class="rec"><div><b>312 eSIMs idle for 60+ days</b><small>Suspend to stop wholesale charges</small></div><div class="rec-r"><strong>$573/mo</strong><span class="apply">Apply</span></div></div>
            <div class="rec"><div><b>Route Japan traffic to lower-cost operator</b><small>Same coverage, lower cost per GB</small></div><div class="rec-r"><strong>$460/mo</strong><span class="apply">Apply</span></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feat-row">
  <div class="wrap">
<div class="frow reveal">
        <div class="ftext">
          <h3>One-stop shopping</h3>
          <p>An all-in-one MVNE platform for eSIM businesses, with procure-to-pay built in from carrier to customer.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fvis" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="stack">
            <span class="stack-end">Procure</span>
            <div class="layer"><span class="ln">01</span><div><b>TelecomHub</b><small>Operators, SIMs, eSIMs</small></div></div>
            <div class="layer"><span class="ln">02</span><div><b>ControlHub</b><small>Pricing, usage, margins</small></div></div>
            <div class="layer"><span class="ln">03</span><div><b>UXHub</b><small>Store, checkout, self-service</small></div></div>
            <span class="stack-end">Pay</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="feat-row feat-row--last">
  <div class="wrap">
<div class="frow rev reveal">
        <div class="ftext">
          <h3>Digital channels enabled</h3>
          <p>Sell through digital channels, accept card payments, and process transactions end to end. Tax and checkout are handled in the flow, so your customer experience stays simple.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="fvis" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="ui ui-light ui-narrow checkout">
            <div class="ui-head"><b>Checkout</b><span class="mono-label">Secure</span></div>
            <div class="line"><span>Japan 10 GB · 30 days</span><b>$12.00</b></div>
            <div class="line muted"><span>Tax</span><span>$0.96</span></div>
            <div class="line total"><span>Total</span><b>$12.96</b></div>
            <div class="cardfield"><span class="brand-chip">VISA</span><span>•••• 4242</span><span class="exp">08/29</span></div>
            <div class="paybtn">Pay $12.96</div>
            <div class="toast"><span class="dot"></span>Payment received. eSIM sent to traveler.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>
